+  "hire.265": "Hire skilled overseas workers in Turkey in 6–8 weeks. İŞKUR-licensed agency (Permit No. 1730) — we file every work permit, vet every candidate, and you pay no upfront fee. Written quote in 24 hours.",
+  "hire.266": "Hire Verified Overseas Workers in Turkey | JobsAdmire",
+  "hire.267": "Skilled workers from 13+ countries, vetted by our own teams, every work permit filed by us — on site in six to eight weeks. No upfront fee.",
+  "hire.268": "İŞKUR-licensed international recruitment agency placing verified overseas workers with employers in Turkey.",
