+  "calc.189": "Local hire vs overseas hire",
+  "calc.190": "The salary and SGK cost are the same for both. Turkish labour law applies to both, and we never quote below the legal minimum. The real question is different: at that wage, in your city, on your shift pattern, does anyone take the job?",
+  "calc.191": "Option A",
