+  "calc.350": "Incentives that require the hire to be registered unemployed at İŞKUR (7103 / geçici 19) cannot be used, because a foreign national cannot hold that registration.",
+  "calc.351": "KOSGEB wage support excludes them by rule",
+  "calc.352": "The qualified-personnel (nitelikli eleman) salary support is written for Turkish citizens with a university degree — foreign nationals are named in the exclusions, alongside retirees and the owner's family. KOSGEB's other programmes fund the business, not this hire.",
+  "calc.353": "What you can get:",
+  "calc.354": "the 5510 premium discount and the minimum wage support above. Both belong to your workplace and both are already in the calculator.",
+  "calc.355": "These discounts depend on your workplace, not on us.",
+  "calc.356": "To get any SGK incentive, the workplace must have no unpaid premium debt, must file its declarations on time and must have no unregistered workers. If one of these is broken, the workplace loses all of them, including the minimum wage support. Ask your mali müşavir before you count on the saving. We always quote the full price without discounts, so there are no surprises.",
