+  "wp.097": "Two legal routes to work in Turkey",
+  "wp.098": "Law No. 6735 gives foreigners two doors: the standard work permit for real employment, and the e-Muafiyet exemption for short, specific assignments. Choosing the wrong one is the most common — and most expensive — mistake.",
