+  "wp.229": "Researchers, performers and athletes for the length of the activity.",
+  "wp.230": "Trainers tied to exports & imports",
+  "wp.231": "Training on goods and services exported from or imported into Turkey.",
+  "wp.232": "More categories exist",
+  "wp.233": "The full Article 48 list also covers diplomatic staff, exchange programmes, ship crews and others — ask us about your case.",
+  "wp.234": "Deadline",
+  "wp.235": "30 days from entry",
